From 7c89d0ca13793c1d7e9f84503ecb0f348fe26d92 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 03:07:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 12/16] Coverflow: a song picked several cards ahead keeps the
 right side in place

Right after the pick, playback has moved on but the shuffle plan has not: the picked card got a fresh key
and the row was rebuilt. Lay the plan out as it will be once it catches up (picked song in the middle,
skipped ones already on the played side), so only the played side folds.

